# 🔄 User Flows

Step-by-step workflows for every role.

## A. Artisan: Onboarding → First Product

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Sign up] --> B[Choose Artisan] --> C[Profile setup] --> D[Craft details]
    D --> E[Optional verification] --> F[Product Studio] --> G[Upload images]
    G --> H[AI suggests title / description / tags] --> I[Artisan reviews] --> J[Publish]
    J --> K[Visible in marketplace]
```

## B. Buyer: Purchase

Sign up → personalized feed → story/product discovery → product details → select variant → cart → address → delivery option → payment → confirmation → order timeline → delivery → review.

## C. Social Discovery

Open Stories → view artisan story → tap product sticker → product page → save / follow / add to cart → optionally share or chat.

## D. Delivery Partner

Go online → job assigned → accept → navigate to pickup → verify package → confirm pickup → route to buyer → OTP / proof → delivered → earnings updated.

## E. Admin: Incident Handling

Alert appears → admin opens incident → AI summarizes verified data → admin checks original records → admin chooses action → action is logged → affected users are notified.

## Checkout Working

Select product/variant → cart validation → stock validation → address → delivery calculation → coupon validation → payment request → **server verifies payment** → order confirmed → artisan notified → delivery workflow begins.

## Chat Working

Message created → backend validates sender and conversation → message stored → real-time update to recipient → notification sent → read state updated.
